* [daveey] Retry a failed notice close-out wake durably after its quota reset

A close-out wake whose agent build failed (quota wall, refused store write)
was stamped closeout.state=error and never offered again; the only retry was
the in-process automation replay, whose timer dies with its backend and whose
own failure gives up. Two hub chats (20261016_123957_6212f7,
20261017_114040_587d59) stayed unresolved{notice_tail} after an
openai-codex quota wall during a state.db corruption window.

